WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.320
Open the existing Protocol in your project. Read its instructions and version.

2
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:14.480
Choose Add Record to open the form.

3
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:22.360
Enter sample DEMO-001 and count 12. These are synthetic values.

4
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:30.720
Complete required fields. A draft is on this device; submission creates the Record.

5
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:37.080
Submit, check the project and Protocol version, then confirm.

6
00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:43.880
After success, open View saved Record to check the result.

7
00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:52.360
Reload: the values remain, confirming platform persistence.

8
00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:59.600
Use Revise for a correction and provide its reason.

9
00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:06.880
Submit the revision. The new revision contains the corrected value.

10
00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:15.240
The original still contains 12. Corrections preserve history.
